# motion-q (plan section 6, M10): FV 05's pointer entering and leaving the plane. The pointer onto
# the empty plane at x = −1.5 (881, 376 at 1440 x 900, as q-at): Q fades in over 160 ms on the enter
# spring, its drop lines growing to the axes over 120 ms; Q's row turns live, its role and readout
# fading in (PointRows.module.css values-in: 160 ms on --motion-ease-enter, CSS's linear() of the
# spring). Every frame of it; then the pointer off the plane onto the top bar (760, 48): Q fades out
# with its lines over 120 ms, linearly, and the row's placeholders fade in, 120 ms linearly.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 881 376
frames q-in every 16 for 176
wait 300
move 760 48
frames q-out every 16 for 144
